{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994109177142001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"dare-titan-tuple","assignee":"","attestations":{"plan-review":{"algorithm":"HMAC-SHA256","author":"Iso Tester","head_sha":"d96628c9dca3d274ac494174d10d50818b8afeea","key_id":"412fa5372ad877e0","kind":"plan-review","manifest":["plan-review: PASS","ticket: 9b19-5456-58ee-4c09","material: 23794fa4079876f0","model: claude-sonnet-4-6","runner: pydantic_ai","blocking: 0","advisory: 15","regver: bb57585159a067c5","verified-at-sha:d96628c9dca3d274ac494174d10d50818b8afeea"],"signature":"17d3391813140fb3f38281de50ead4f911e01e5e474c22037deeb560824d630a","signed_at":1782959079972784000}},"author":"Iso Tester","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":7},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Iso Tester","body":"Code committed e6e5d42c: .github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml (3-job g2p shape, reuses test.yml checks, SHA-pinned). Operator-pending: verify it dispatches + votes once creds (S4) are set.","timestamp":1782966620121804001}],"created_at":1782956276675691001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"a6e17a16-fb32-4648-8a93-e875e4b900f5","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"2467-7f24-1204-4d15"}],"description":"# S5 — The `gerrit-verify.yaml` workflow (reuse `test.yml`)\n\nPart of epic 1fa8 (CI as a second Gerrit gate vote via gerrit-to-platform → GitHub Actions).\n\n## Why\nThis is the workflow g2p dispatches — it runs the SAME checks as `.github/workflows/test.yml` and\ncasts the `Verified` vote. It follows the fixed 3-job g2p production shape (clear-vote →\nbuild-and-test → vote), keeping checks drift-free by reusing the existing steps.\n\n## What\nAuthor `.github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml` with `workflow_dispatch` + the nine `GERRIT_*`\ninputs and the three jobs, all third-party actions SHA-pinned.\n\n## Scope\n- `.github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml` (and optionally converge with `test.yml`).\n- Depends on S4 (the GitHub vars/secret) and references the `Verified` label from S1.\n- Out of scope: g2p host install (S3), the gate activation (S6).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Author `.github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml` triggered by `workflow_dispatch` with the nine\n      `GERRIT_*` inputs; `concurrency` keyed on the change with `cancel-in-progress: true`.\n- [ ] `clear-vote` job: `lfreleng-actions/gerrit-review-action` `vote-type: clear` (resets\n      `Verified→0`; verified semantics) + a short `sleep` for replication.\n- [ ] `build-and-test` job: `lfreleng-actions/checkout-gerrit-change-action` (fetch the exact\n      `GERRIT_REFSPEC`) then the existing `test.yml` steps (lint / typecheck / test matrix + the\n      module-size / prompt-index / criteria-routing gates + coverage floor).\n- [ ] `vote` job (`if: always()`): `im-open/workflow-conclusion` then `gerrit-review-action\n      vote-type: ${{ WORKFLOW_CONCLUSION }}` → `Verified` +1/-1, with the run URL in the vote message.\n- [ ] SHA-pin all third-party actions; decide `test.yml` convergence (recommend the\n      `gerrit-verify-manual-dispatch.yaml` hybrid so one file serves Gerrit dispatch + manual runs).","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["depends_on","2467-7f24-1204-4d15"],["parent","1fa8-9db4-7c1c-48f3"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"1fa8-9db4-7c1c-48f3","parent_status_uuid":"35a62c26-58a6-4c56-a4ae-9db81a380b8e","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"9b19-5456-58ee-4c09","ticket_type":"story","title":"S5 — The gerrit-verify.yaml workflow (reuse test.yml)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["585f61f8-854c-4c05-b600-fa7390049981","a6e17a16-fb32-4648-8a93-e875e4b900f5","ab4ef92a-a59d-47bb-b744-b39a6f14604e","d5d5be51-376a-48d0-a1e9-91e827bfb6d0","35a62c26-58a6-4c56-a4ae-9db81a380b8e","b7b518da-c991-4b8e-9eb5-69b3246114ea","9bf28fb3-d379-4683-b94d-ede78d62427a","b694f673-20f9-46ce-a4b1-99d17b38016f"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994109177142001,"uuid":"f6d88e7b-9ec1-485e-aa46-ce08e020d088"}